acique", "km": [{"ep": "OS", "label": "Survie globale", "source": "Figure 1A, Carbone ESMO Open 2025 (analyse finale, 6 ans)", "digitized": true, "arms": [{"arm": "Nivo-ipi + chimio", "points": [[0.0, 100.0], [0.5, 99.4], [1.0, 97.9], [1.5, 97.1], [2.0, 95.6], [2.5, 93.3], [3.0, 91.4], [3.5, 89.8], [4.0, 87.9], [4.5, 85.6], [5.0, 83.7], [5.5, 83.3], [6.0, 81.0], [6.5, 79.9], [7.0, 78.0], [7.5, 76.4], [8.0, 73.0], [8.5, 71.8], [9.0, 69.9], [9.5, 68.8], [10.0, 67.6], [10.5, 66.9], [11.0, 65.7], [11.5, 65.3], [12.0, 63.8], [12.5, 62.3], [13.0, 60.3], [13.5, 58.4], [14.0, 55.7], [14.5, 54.2], [15.0, 53.1], [15.5, 52.3], [16.0, 50.0], [16.5, 49.2], [17.0, 48.9], [17.5, 47.7], [18.0, 47.3], [18.5, 46.9], [19.0, 46.2], [19.5, 45.4], [20.0, 44.6], [20.5, 43.1], [21.0, 41.6], [21.5, 41.6], [22.0, 41.2], [22.5, 40.8], [23.0, 40.4], [23.5, 38.9], [24.0, 38.5], [24.5, 37.0], [25.0, 37.0], [25.5, 36.6], [26.0, 35.4], [26.5, 34.7], [27.0, 34.7], [27.5, 34.3], [28.0, 33.5], [28.5, 33.1], [29.0, 33.1], [29.5, 32.4], [30.0, 32.0], [30.5, 31.6], [31.0, 31.2], [31.5, 31.2], [32.0, 30.8], [32.5, 30.5], [33.0, 29.3], [33.5, 28.5], [34.0, 28.5], [34.5, 28.2], [35.0, 27.8], [35.5, 27.4], [36.0, 26.6], [36.5, 26.2], [37.0, 26.2], [37.5, 26.2], [38.0, 26.2], [38.5, 25.5], [39.0, 25.5], [39.5, 25.5], [40.0, 25.1], [40.5, 25.1], [41.0, 25.1], [41.5, 25.1], [42.0, 24.7], [42.5, 24.3], [43.0, 23.6], [43.5, 23.6], [44.0, 23.2], [44.5, 22.8], [45.0, 22.4], [45.5, 22.0], [46.0, 22.0], [46.5, 22.0], [47.0, 21.6], [47.5, 21.3], [48.0, 20.9], [48.5, 20.5], [49.0, 20.5], [49.5, 20.1], [50.0, 20.1], [50.5, 20.1], [51.0, 20.1], [51.5, 20.1], [52.0, 20.1], [52.5, 19.7], [53.0, 19.3], [53.5, 19.3], [54.0, 19.3], [54.5, 19.3], [55.0, 19.3], [55.5, 19.3], [56.0, 19.3], [56.5, 19.3], [57.0, 19.3], [57.5, 19.3], [58.0, 19.3], [58.5, 19.3], [59.0, 19.3], [59.5, 19.0], [60.0, 18.2], [60.5, 18.2], [61.0, 18.2], [61.5, 17.8], [62.0, 17.8], [62.5, 17.8], [63.0, 17.8], [63.5, 17.8], [64.0, 17.0], [64.5, 17.0], [65.